* **00:11–00:12 | Spontaneous Object Spawning (Shot 3):** The lost brown slipper on the right side of the road materializes out of thin air in the snow at 00:11 before the boy runs into frame to grab it.
* **00:15–00:21 | Background Pedestrian Morphing & Moonwalking (Shot 5):**
  * On the left, two men in top hats walk merged together; at 00:17–00:18 their coats and limbs morph into a single three-legged figure before splitting apart, with one sliding backward.
  * In the center background, a dark figure splits/morphs into two figures at 00:17.
